# AI Collaboration Rules
CRITICAL: Read `AI_FILE_LOCKS.md` before making any changes.
DO NOT modify, overwrite, delete, or refactor any files listed as LOCKED in `AI_FILE_LOCKS.md`.
Those files belong exclusively to Partner 1's AI agent.
Always build new features in separate files/folders (e.g. `src/features/` or `src/components/friend/`).
